{"id": "2592", "type": "page", "slug": "nuro-size", "path": "programs/online-programs/nuro-size", "title": "Nuro-Size", "date": "2025-04-15 14:20:21", "modified": "2026-08-25 18:51:11", "excerpt": "", "content": "<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/spa_logo.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"231\" />\r\n\r\nWhole Body Therapies &amp; Treatments to Support Optimal Wellbeing\r\n\r\nTripadvisor rating:\r\n\r\n<img title=\"\" src=\"/images/tripadvisor.svg\" alt=\"\" />\r\n<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/card_header-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"410\" height=\"220\" />\r\n<ul>\r\n \t<li>\r\nComprehensive Online Quantum Fitness Program</li>\r\n \t<li>\r\nIntegrates Physical Activity with Cognitive Challenges</li>\r\n \t<li>\r\nMinimal to No Equipment Needed</li>\r\n \t<li>\r\nBoosts Cardiovascular Endurance, Muscle Strength, and Flexibility</li>\r\n \t<li>\r\nPromotes Neuroplasticity for Cognitive Resilience</li>\r\n \t<li>\r\nAdaptable Workouts for All Ages and Fitness Levels</li>\r\n \t<li>\r\nOnline Subscription Model - $9.99 Monthly</li>\r\n \t<li>\r\nAnd much more...</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Full online access: $9.99 / Month</h2>\r\n<a href=\"https://hippocratesonlineprograms.mykajabi.com/offers/DZLgxc72\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\r\n\r\nSubscribe\r\n</a>\r\n/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ff930f3d-26e92d01.mp4\r\n\r\n<strong>Introducing Nuro-Size</strong> – a revolutionary online fitness program designed to enhance cognitive and physical performance for a longer, healthier life. By integrating physical activity with cognitive challenges, Nuro-Size promotes four core health goals: Balance, Recovery, Strength, and Flow. This program combines aerobic exercises, strength training, and flexibility routines with tasks that stimulate memory, attention, and problem-solving skills, leveraging neuroplasticity to build physical strength, sharpen mental focus, and improve balance.\r\n\r\nNuro-Size offers adaptable workouts for any age or fitness level. Regular participation boosts physical health and cognitive resilience, supporting brain health as you age. The program provides guided videos for exercises you can do alone or with a partner, all from the comfort of your home. With new videos continually added, your training will always be fresh and engaging.\r\n\r\nExperience the transformative power of Nuro-Size. This innovative program alleviates pain, enhances blood flow, and boosts organ function, fueling both body and mind. Make Nuro-Size part of your daily routine and embark on a journey towards optimal health and happiness.\r\n\r\n<strong><a href=\"https://hippocratesonlineprograms.mykajabi.com/offers/DZLgxc72\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-anchor=\"#\">Subscribe now to elevate your wellbeing to new heights.</a></strong>\r\n\r\n<section><picture><source srcset=\"/media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=545&amp;rnd=133233452311870000, /media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=818&amp;rnd=133233452311870000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1500px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=510&amp;rnd=133233452311870000, /media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=765&amp;rnd=133233452311870000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1499px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=330&amp;rnd=133233452311870000, /media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=495&amp;rnd=133233452311870000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1199px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=290&amp;rnd=133233452311870000, /media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=435&amp;rnd=13323345231187000