0 62 621 62 721 108 808 192M438 392V642L642 517 438 392Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-210ef2a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"210ef2a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"block-text1-col spt spb-half doctors-and-health-experts\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col\"><p><strong>Introducing Nuro-Size</strong> – a revolutionary online fitness program designed to enhance cognitive and physical performance for a longer, healthier life. By integrating physical activity with cognitive challenges, Nuro-Size promotes four core health goals: Balance, Recovery, Strength, and Flow. This program combines aerobic exercises, strength training, and flexibility routines with tasks that stimulate memory, attention, and problem-solving skills, leveraging neuroplasticity to build physical strength, sharpen mental focus, and improve balance.</p><p>Nuro-Size offers adaptable workouts for any age or fitness level. Regular participation boosts physical health and cognitive resilience, supporting brain health as you age. The program provides guided videos for exercises you can do alone or with a partner, all from the comfort of your home. With new videos continually added, your training will always be fresh and engaging.</p><p>Experience the transformative power of Nuro-Size. This innovative program alleviates pain, enhances blood flow, and boosts organ function, fueling both body and mind. Make Nuro-Size part of your daily routine and embark on a journey towards optimal health and happiness.</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><a class=\"text-primary\" href=\"https://hippocratesonlineprograms.mykajabi.com/offers/DZLgxc72\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-anchor=\"#\">Subscribe now to elevate your wellbeing to new heights.</a></strong></span></p></div></div></div></div><section class=\"block-images-with-text sptnone spb-half doctors-and-health-experts\"><div class=\"container \"><div class=\"row justify-content-center\"><div class=\"col-md-4 mb-30 mb-lg-50\"><div class=\"card bg-white text-secondary text-center\"><div class=\"ratio-1by1 card-image\"><picture><source srcset=\"/media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=545&amp;rnd=133233452311870000, /media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=818&amp;rnd=133233452311870000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1500px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=510&amp;rnd=133233452311870000, /media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=765&amp;rnd=133233452311870000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1499px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=330&amp;rnd=133233452311870000, /media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=495&amp;rnd=133233452311870000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1199px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=290&amp;rnd=133233452311870000, /media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=435&amp;rnd=133233452311870000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=350&amp;rnd=133233452311870000, /media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=525&amp;rnd=133233452311870000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 576px) and (max-width: 767px)\"